  "hypothesis": "Parallelizing only over starting rows and using an explicit SIMD reduction over the contiguous column dimension, with precomputed row-offset pointers, exposes legal vectorization of independent submatrix sums while reducing thread scheduling overhead compared to collapse(2), improving runtime.",
